  "preferred": "F3: Go conflates JSON decoding with request validation, uses parse-error ID 0, and accepts invalid version/handshake inputs. Preferred: validate JSON-RPC envelopes separately, use -32700 only for invalid JSON with id:null, -32600 for invalid requests, preserve valid IDs, and reject unsupported plugin protocol before load."
